                          <h2 class="rmcc-text-normal rmcc-margin-remove-top">Kilbeggan Community Group CLG is sponsored by 24 community & voluntary groups across South Westmeath.</h2>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rmcc-width-1-1 rmcc-width-expand@xl rmcc-flex rmcc-flex-left rmcc-flex-right@xl">
