          <div class="rmcc-container rmcc-section">

            <div class="rmcc-text-center rmcc-margin-medium-bottom">
              <h2 class="rmcc-h1 rmcc-text-primary">What is the Community Employment Scheme?</h2>
              <p class="rmcc-text-lead slight-bold">Community Employment is an employment programme funded by the <span class="rmcc-text-bold nice-blue text-underline">Department of Employment Affairs and Social Protection</span>, which helps long-term unemployed people to re-enter the active workforce by offering part-time and temporary placements within local voluntary communities and organisations. The benefits of partcicpating in a CE scheme include:</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class=" rmcc-margin-large-bottom">
              <div class="rmcc-child-width-1-2@m" rmcc-grid>
                <div class="rmcc-text-center">
                  <span class="nice-green" rmcc-icon="icon: user; ratio: 2"></span>
                  <h4 class="rmcc-text-primary rmcc-margin-top">Practical Experience</h4>
                  <p class="text-slightly-larger">CE Scheme participants gain meaningful practical experience to enhance & develop their technical & personal skills.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rmcc-text-center">
                  <span class="nice-green" rmcc-icon="icon: file-edit; ratio: 2"></span>
                  <h4 class="rmcc-text-primary rmcc-margin-top">Training Opportunities</h4>
                  <p class="text-slightly-larger">Each participant designs an <span class="rmcc-text-bold">Individual Training Plan (ILP)</span> which links work experience with both job-specific & progression training.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rmcc-text-center">
                  <span class="nice-green" rmcc-icon="icon: star; ratio: 2"></span>
                  <h4 class="rmcc-text-primary rmcc-margin-top">QQI-Accredited Courses</h4>
                  <p class="text-slightly-larger">Participants can avail of the opportunity to achieve major, QQI-accredited (up to level 6) awards which are tailored to suit the needs & career goals of any individual.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rmcc-text-center">
                  <span class="nice-green" rmcc-icon="icon: forward; ratio: 2"></span>
                  <h4 class="rmcc-text-primary rmcc-margin-top">Future Employment</h4>
                  <p class="text-slightly-larger">Participants are encouraged to seek further employment upon completion, where they can make use of the new skills & qualifications they have gained during placement.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rmcc-text-center">
              <h3 class="rmcc-text-primary rmcc-margin-top">To see our currently available CE scheme placements:</h3>
              <div class="rmcc-flex rmcc-flex-center">
                <a class="rmcc-button rmcc-button-default rmcc-button-gradient rmcc-border-rounded" href="#Jobs" rmcc-scroll>View Latest Jobs</a>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

